-- הסכם קיבוצי — שעות פעילות גן, מחנכי כיתה והקצאת שעות למורים בעלי
-- תפקידים בחטיבות ביניים (17.9.2013), the complete CMS copy: a second copy
-- of the September 2013 agreement, encoded in
-- `2013-09-17_ofek-hadash_september-2013-agreement`. Every row it shares
-- with that copy is cited here as that copy's row and carries no rule of
-- its own. It differs in two ways: it has no registration stamp, so its
-- preamble's rows sit one place earlier; and it prints the whole of §15א,
-- which §10(ב) adds to the base agreement and which the scan of the
-- primary copy breaks off where a page is missing. §15א is encoded here,
-- on the rules for role holders the primary copy writes for §17א, with
-- §15's week (a primary school) and the classes of grades 7–9.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-15`
IMPORT `2013-09-17_ofek-hadash_september-2013-agreement`

§ `הסכם ספטמבר 2013 — העותק המלא ממערכת ה־CMS — 17.9.2013`

