§§ `10(ב) סעיף 15א להסכם הכולל — שעות תפקיד למורים בעלי תפקידים המלמדים בכיתות ז' עד ט' בבית ספר יסודי`

-- §15א as (ב) adds it, whole. Its opening: a teacher in a primary school
-- with grade 7, 8 or 9 who teaches those grades and fills a role below
-- keeps §15's week, and is allotted hours for the role, in the school:
-- (א) a grade coordinator of one of grades 7–9, the grade having 4 classes
-- or more, (1) half an hour a class in the grade, 6 at most, in place of
-- frontal hours (§15(ב)), and (2) half an hour a class, up to the
-- individual hours of his position, in place of individual hours (§15(ג));
-- (ב) a social-education coordinator 0.4 of an hour a class of grades 7, 8
-- and 9 in the school, in place of frontal hours; (ג) a subject
-- coordinator, from a pool for them all of half an hour a class of grades
-- 7–9, what the principal allots him, an hour at most, in place of frontal
-- hours; (ד) subject to his teaching at least 12 frontal hours in a full
-- position, or, in a part position or with age hours, 50% of his table's
-- frontal hours and never fewer than 6 (a grade coordinator) or 8. These
-- are §17א's rules with grades 7–9 for the junior high, and §15א has no
-- (ה): so the classes counted are those of grades 7–9 and nothing is
-- taught in an upper division. F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-cms-a: (ד)
-- leaves open, as §17א(ד) does, what becomes of role hours that would take
-- him below the minimum; the reading is F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-c's.
@ref akn:art_10__para_b
GIVEN `the school has grade 7, 8 or 9` IS A BOOLEAN, `teaches in those grades` IS A BOOLEAN, r IS A `role holder under §§15א and 17א`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§15א, as the CMS copy prints it, reaches` `the school has grade 7, 8 or 9` `teaches in those grades` r IF
    `§15א reaches the teacher` `the school has grade 7, 8 or 9` `teaches in those grades` TRUE

-- A primary-school role holder in a position of `share` of a full one,
-- with no age hours, §15's week pro rata: 26 frontal and 5 individual
-- hours in a full position.
GIVEN share IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א`
DECIDE `a primary-school role holder in grades 7–9, in a position of` share IS
    `role holder's position under §§15א and 17א` WITH
        `frontal hours by the work-week table` IS share TIMES `a primary teacher's full week`'s `frontal hours`
        `individual hours in his position`     IS share TIMES `a primary teacher's full week`'s `individual hours`
        `a full position without age hours`    IS share EQUALS 1
        `frontal hours in the upper division`  IS 0

-- A grade coordinator of a 6-class grade in a full position: 3 hours off
-- the frontal and 3 off the individual hours; of a 12-class grade, 6 and 5.
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` (`the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 6) 18 (`a primary-school role holder in grades 7–9, in a position of` 1) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `role hours in place of individual hours` (`the grade coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 12) (`a primary-school role holder in grades 7–9, in a position of` 1) EQUALS 5
-- A social-education coordinator with 12 classes in grades 7–9: 4.8 hours.
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 12 (`a primary-school role holder in grades 7–9, in a position of` 1) EQUALS 4.8
#ASSERT `the subject coordinators' pool` 12 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `§15א, as the CMS copy prints it, reaches` TRUE TRUE `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א`

-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-cms-a's evidence: a social-education
-- coordinator in a half position (13 frontal hours by §15's table, so a
-- minimum of 8) with 15 classes in grades 7–9 is computed 6 hours, which
-- would leave him 7.
`a half-position social-education coordinator of 15 classes in grades 7–9 would fall below the frontal minimum` MEANS
    (`a primary-school role holder in grades 7–9, in a position of` 0.5)'s `frontal hours by the work-week table`
        MINUS `role hours in place of frontal hours, as (א)–(ג) compute them` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 15
    LESS THAN `the frontal minimum of` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` (`a primary-school role holder in grades 7–9, in a position of` 0.5)
#ASSERT `a half-position social-education coordinator of 15 classes in grades 7–9 would fall below the frontal minimum`
#ASSERT `role hours in place of frontal hours` `the social-education coordinator of §§15א and 17א` 15 (`a primary-school role holder in grades 7–9, in a position of` 0.5) EQUALS 5

